ebo_noah）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260104/1084434141916827648362159.jpeg/Qezj4DhPM-CLpEAHgjnSmbUud6_FpoRBAjfG4wI3xuM\" alt=\"加納「先知」挪亞Ebo Noah（Instagram@ebo_noah）\"><figcaption>加納「先知」挪亞Ebo Noah（Instagram@ebo_noah）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260104/1084434144001527808824190.jpeg/L3d0HVmNypPPLoJmnAI01FEpj4gYxiiphRwVFIUcFRQ\" alt=\"加納「先知」挪亞Ebo Noah（Instagram@ebo_noah）\"><figcaption>加納「先知」挪亞Ebo Noah（Instagram@ebo_noah）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>命理師簡少年「預言2026鼠患」影片被翻出　網驚呼：好準</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T14:59:06.785126+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2643,"images":33,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}